{"4739650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rongu", "steam_appid": 4739650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4739840], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <strong>Rongú</strong>, every duel moves to the rhythm of the music. Every hit, dodge, and counterattack must be executed in sync with the beat to unleash the full power of your moves. The better you keep the rhythm, the stronger and more precise your actions become.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rongú</strong> is a turn-based RPG with rhythm combat inspired by Afro-Esmerealdan culture. In this adventure, you take on the role of <strong>Rongú</strong>, a young man who escapes the invasion of his village and ventures into the forest in search of help for his people. Along the way, he will meet ancient spirits who guide him on a mission shaped by danger, memory, and destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739650/extras/49df99be8fc7857bd56f657c25d8d220.poster.avif?t=1781569058\" width=1024 height=1024 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4739650/extras/49df99be8fc7857bd56f657c25d8d220.webm?t=1781569058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master battles where timing is everything, chain combos with precision, and learn to follow the rhythm to survive increasingly challenging encounters. With an original soundtrack and a narrative inspired by Afro-Esmerealdan mythology, <strong>Rongú</strong> delivers an experience where action, music, and story come together in one adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop plays